<p>This tutorial describes how to add a new visitable location to the single player world map. It is assumed that the reader is familiar with <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Creating%20a%20module" title="Creating a module">Creating a module</a>, and the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Area%20tutorial" title="Area tutorial">Area tutorial</a>. 
</p>
